<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Maxtel says in Zimbabwe mobile phone deal.</title>
<headline>Maxtel says in Zimbabwe mobile phone deal.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Maxtel Ltd said on Tuesday that it had reached agreement in principle with Cosmos Cellular (Pvt) Ltd to set up a joint venture cellular payphone network in Zimbabwe.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that Cosmos was the leading cellular service provider to the sole GSM cellular network in Zimbabwe, Net One.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
